  g_pattern='#.*(todo:?[[:space:]]*implement|in a real (implementation|app|application|system|project|world)|in production,? (you|we) would|placeholder (implementation|logic|code|value|for now)|stub(bed)? (implementation|for now)|implement (this|me) (later|properly))'
  g_desc='No placeholder comments on added lines ("TODO implement", "in a real implementation", "placeholder logic"); write the code or say what is missing.'
